<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37172" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξερεύγομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>vomit forth,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλῆθος βατράχων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Wi.</u>
					19.10
				</span></i>
			, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφρόν,</span> of honey when
			boiled, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.273
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγον ἀγαθόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ps.</u>
					44(45).1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of a tumour,
				<i>break out,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prorrh.</u>
				1.168
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Med.
			 or 
				Pass.
			, of rivers, <i>empty themselves,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.202
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				603a14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				1.9
			</span></i>, etc.; of veins, <i>discharge,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Oss.</u>
				14
			</span></i>. (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξερυγγάνω.</span>)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
